# Every file here is content-hashed by MANIFEST.txt and checked by the test suite,
# so git must not rewrite line endings: a checkout that turned LF into CRLF would
# change the bytes and make the manifest disagree with the tree.  `-text` disables
# the conversion for everything; diffs still work normally.
#
# This matters more here than in a Python-only tree.  The VocalPatch folder ships
# PowerShell and .txt files that carry a UTF-8 BOM on purpose - Windows PowerShell
# 5.1 reads a .ps1 without a BOM as ANSI and turns the Chinese text in them into
# mojibake - and `VocalPatch/.gitattributes` says the same thing for that subtree.
* -text

# The shipped binaries are binary in every sense.
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
